WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:02.102
- That's what we're here to say,

00:00:02.102 --> 00:00:04.104 line:0%
is that we are the new
Black Panther Party.

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:06.973 line:0%
- [Reporter] What's the biggest
problem facing the movement?

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:09.309 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
- Well, you know, we
supposed to be in this era

00:00:09.309 --> 00:00:13.813 align:start position:0% line:0%
of so-called post-racial harmony
with all people in America,

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:16.850 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
but us blacks are being
murdered all over the place.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:20.520 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
And we get the same treatment
time and time again!

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.489 align:start size:84% position:16%
We're not even
second-class citizens.

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:24.024
We third-class!

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:27.861
Stand up black America and
declare to white America

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:30.230
that we aint gonna
take this no more.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.498
Okay!

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:32.632
- [Reporter] Why come
out now and say this?

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:33.900
- You know what?

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:37.470
You had 400 years to
get it right, America.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.506
But you don't know how
to treat your people.

00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:42.308
All people, it's
time to stand up!

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:43.877
It's time to take back!

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:46.346
It's time for us to fight back!

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:48.381
And we won't take your
phony words anymore.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.349
We're not gonna do it!

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:52.185
We want concrete results!

00:00:52.185 --> 00:00:56.623
You hear what we're saying to
you, United Snakes of America?

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:59.492 align:start position:0%
What are you supposed to do
when the whole world is watching

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:01.795
and no one is saying anything?

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:04.364
We will not be silent!

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:07.167
- [Reporter] Okay, you, sir,
anything you wanted to say?

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:09.369
- Oh, me?

00:01:09.369 --> 00:01:10.203
No, I'm good.

